1
00:00:34,220 --> 00:00:37,970
[Five years ago, Tianjiu Alley]

2
00:00:50,680 --> 00:00:51,760
What are you doing here?

3
00:00:51,760 --> 00:00:52,760
Why?

4
00:00:52,760 --> 00:00:55,400
Do you own Tianjiu Alley?

5
00:00:55,520 --> 00:00:56,720
Am I not allowed here?

6
00:00:57,680 --> 00:00:59,480
Only poor people live here.

7
00:00:59,480 --> 00:01:01,440
They are not rich young masters like you.

8
00:01:01,440 --> 00:01:02,840
They don't have time to play with you.

9
00:01:02,840 --> 00:01:03,960
I'm warning you.

10
00:01:04,080 --> 00:01:05,840
If you dare to make fun of them,

11
00:01:05,870 --> 00:01:06,670
I'll...

12
00:01:07,040 --> 00:01:07,920
You'll what?

13
00:01:08,400 --> 00:01:09,240
Hit me?

14
00:01:10,560 --> 00:01:11,030
Come on.

15
00:01:11,280 --> 00:01:12,240
Hit me right here.

16
00:01:12,240 --> 00:01:12,720
You...

17
00:01:13,280 --> 00:01:14,480
What exactly do you want?

18
00:01:14,480 --> 00:01:16,360
I can do whatever I want.

19
00:01:16,720 --> 00:01:18,160
Do you think you're a cop,

20
00:01:18,240 --> 00:01:19,320
who can mind everyone's business?

21
00:01:19,320 --> 00:01:20,440
Shen.

22
00:01:20,670 --> 00:01:22,310
Is Lu here?

23
00:01:24,160 --> 00:01:25,000
Let go.

24
00:01:27,900 --> 00:01:29,940
Do you want her to see us fighting?

25
00:01:34,759 --> 00:01:35,680
Lu.

26
00:01:36,390 --> 00:01:37,670
Lu, you're here.

27
00:01:38,840 --> 00:01:39,479
Granny.

28
00:01:39,600 --> 00:01:42,200
Here is the delivery this time.
Please take it.

29
00:01:42,280 --> 00:01:43,680
Thank your father for me.

30
00:01:43,759 --> 00:01:45,450
He knows our life is not easy.

31
00:01:45,640 --> 00:01:47,560
He often sends things over.

32
00:01:47,759 --> 00:01:48,880
Thanks for your hard work.

33
00:01:48,880 --> 00:01:49,740
It's nothing, Granny.

34
00:01:49,740 --> 00:01:51,200
I'm just running errands.

35
00:01:52,880 --> 00:01:54,880
Shen, you're also a good boy.

36
00:01:55,100 --> 00:01:57,100
You always come to the alley to help.

37
00:01:57,120 --> 00:01:58,720
Thanks to both of you.

38
00:01:59,400 --> 00:02:01,340
Granny, if there's nothing else,
I'll leave first.

39
00:02:01,340 --> 00:02:02,300
Don't go.

40
00:02:02,720 --> 00:02:05,850
Today, you both have to stay for dinner
before you leave.

41
00:02:06,440 --> 00:02:08,039
I'll go cook for you.

42
00:02:10,160 --> 00:02:10,639
Come.

43
00:02:10,639 --> 00:02:11,480
Sit, sit, sit.

44
00:02:11,480 --> 00:02:12,280
Sit down.

45
00:02:12,280 --> 00:02:13,400
Sit.

46
00:02:14,160 --> 00:02:15,560
You guys have a good chat.

47
00:02:55,120 --> 00:02:56,920
Just because you're a good guy,

48
00:02:58,450 --> 00:03:00,910
you don't have to
apologize for wronging me?

49
00:03:06,200 --> 00:03:07,120
I was wrong.

50
00:03:16,780 --> 00:03:17,900
I'm sorry.

51
00:03:22,440 --> 00:03:23,600
Who cares?

52
00:03:37,370 --> 00:03:39,700
[Eclipse in the Lost City] [Episode 9]

53
00:03:40,240 --> 00:03:41,900
You should know better than me

54
00:03:42,280 --> 00:03:43,810
who lives in Tianjiu Alley.

55
00:03:44,400 --> 00:03:48,400
Or have you forgotten because it's been
so long since you worked as a cop?

56
00:03:57,520 --> 00:04:00,080
You're still protecting him
after all this?

57
00:04:01,780 --> 00:04:02,580
Yes.

58
00:04:07,760 --> 00:04:08,670
Why?

59
00:04:08,960 --> 00:04:10,360
Do I need a reason?

60
00:04:10,360 --> 00:04:11,080
Of course.

61
00:04:12,800 --> 00:04:14,500
He's from the Shisha Gang.

62
00:04:14,640 --> 00:04:15,520
So am I.

63
00:04:20,640 --> 00:04:23,080
I must take him away today.

64
00:04:26,920 --> 00:04:28,440
What if I refuse?

65
00:04:32,200 --> 00:04:34,530
No. 7 Liutiao Lane in the western suburbs.

66
00:04:34,920 --> 00:04:37,000
Uncle Zhong's
wife and daughter live there,

67
00:04:37,000 --> 00:04:37,640
right?

68
00:04:49,159 --> 00:04:50,240
What do you want?

69
00:04:50,880 --> 00:04:53,480
Two lives for his one.

70
00:04:54,800 --> 00:04:58,400
It seems Xu Qingdao isn't all that good
at keeping his men in line.

71
00:04:58,800 --> 00:05:00,160
The rules of the underworld say

72
00:05:00,160 --> 00:05:01,620
families are off-limits.

73
00:05:02,000 --> 00:05:02,880
Officer Shen,

74
00:05:03,960 --> 00:05:05,360
if I remember correctly,

75
00:05:06,320 --> 00:05:07,720
when you were a cop,

76
00:05:07,720 --> 00:05:09,320
you were all about the rules.

77
00:05:09,440 --> 00:05:10,900
How come you've regressed

78
00:05:11,180 --> 00:05:12,460
after joining a gang?

79
00:05:12,490 --> 00:05:13,420
Young Master Lu,

80
00:05:13,760 --> 00:05:16,400
you don't need to worry about my affairs.

81
00:05:20,760 --> 00:05:22,490
Targeting women and children.

82
00:05:22,800 --> 00:05:23,880
Shen Tianbai,

83
00:05:23,880 --> 00:05:25,400
do you have no shame?

84
00:05:25,650 --> 00:05:26,570
One word.

85
00:05:26,640 --> 00:05:29,320
Are you going to make this deal or not?

86
00:05:33,760 --> 00:05:34,920
From your tone,

87
00:05:35,480 --> 00:05:37,880
it sounds like
you already know the answer.

88
00:05:38,120 --> 00:05:38,920
Of course.

89
00:05:39,960 --> 00:05:42,020
You dare to gamble with your own life,

90
00:05:42,320 --> 00:05:44,560
but not with theirs.

91
00:05:55,960 --> 00:05:56,760
Fine.

92
00:05:57,510 --> 00:05:59,630
I'll make this deal.

93
00:06:02,960 --> 00:06:03,800
But

94
00:06:04,440 --> 00:06:08,040
street deals go by street rules.

95
00:06:08,240 --> 00:06:09,680
He entered my territory

96
00:06:09,760 --> 00:06:10,760
and beat up my men.

97
00:06:11,240 --> 00:06:12,400
I can spare his life.

98
00:06:12,730 --> 00:06:14,930
But whatever injuries my men suffered,

99
00:06:15,080 --> 00:06:17,240
he has to pay back in full.

100
00:06:20,280 --> 00:06:21,120
Two ribs.

101
00:06:21,560 --> 00:06:22,800
Not one less.

102
00:06:24,840 --> 00:06:25,430
I...

103
00:06:33,450 --> 00:06:35,730
Will you do it, or should I?

104
00:06:44,080 --> 00:06:45,000
I'll do it.

105
00:06:46,520 --> 00:06:47,230
Okay.

106
00:06:50,500 --> 00:06:51,980
I'll pay for him.

107
00:07:00,840 --> 00:07:02,280
You are really loyal.

108
00:07:05,080 --> 00:07:05,880
Alright.

109
00:07:06,860 --> 00:07:08,320
Then I'll grant your wish.

110
00:07:14,920 --> 00:07:15,720
Come here.

111
00:07:18,620 --> 00:07:19,420
Come here.

112
00:07:36,970 --> 00:07:39,300
Do I have to teach you
how to take a beating?

113
00:08:19,320 --> 00:08:22,280
I accept it this time.

114
00:08:23,480 --> 00:08:25,120
I misjudged you.

115
00:08:27,560 --> 00:08:28,760
-Tianbai.
-Tianbai.

116
00:08:30,120 --> 00:08:31,180
Keep an eye on them.

117
00:08:31,240 --> 00:08:32,280
Without my permission,

118
00:08:32,280 --> 00:08:33,360
no one makes a move.

119
00:08:37,200 --> 00:08:38,120
But next time,

120
00:08:40,159 --> 00:08:41,720
I will definitely kill you.

121
00:08:52,450 --> 00:08:53,290
Get lost!

122
00:09:36,640 --> 00:09:37,440
Young Master.

123
00:09:38,400 --> 00:09:39,200
Young Master.

124
00:09:40,040 --> 00:09:40,770
Uncle Zhong.

125
00:09:41,040 --> 00:09:42,040
I'm really sorry.

126
00:09:42,320 --> 00:09:44,180
I brought trouble to your family.

127
00:09:44,240 --> 00:09:45,560
What are you talking about?

128
00:09:45,560 --> 00:09:46,760
Young Master, don't worry.

129
00:09:46,760 --> 00:09:48,080
My wife is fine.

130
00:09:48,480 --> 00:09:49,280
Don't worry.

131
00:09:49,360 --> 00:09:50,480
Have a seat.

132
00:09:52,600 --> 00:09:54,080
How much did you drink?

133
00:09:57,030 --> 00:09:57,790
A little bit.

134
00:09:58,800 --> 00:09:59,800
A little bit?

135
00:09:59,800 --> 00:10:00,280
This...

136
00:10:00,280 --> 00:10:01,800
You call this a little bit?

137
00:10:02,000 --> 00:10:02,290
All right,

138
00:10:02,290 --> 00:10:04,290
I'll go make you some hangover soup.

139
00:10:05,600 --> 00:10:06,330
Uncle Zhong.

140
00:10:06,680 --> 00:10:07,480
What's wrong, Young Master?

141
00:10:07,480 --> 00:10:08,240
Tell me,

142
00:10:10,000 --> 00:10:12,460
why do people become
what they hate the most?

143
00:10:15,520 --> 00:10:16,320
Forget it.

144
00:10:17,440 --> 00:10:18,480
I'm no better.

145
00:10:19,880 --> 00:10:20,800
Young Master.

146
00:10:20,880 --> 00:10:22,410
I have no right to judge him.

147
00:10:25,520 --> 00:10:27,050
It doesn't matter anymore.

148
00:10:30,190 --> 00:10:31,140
Tianbai.

149
00:10:31,520 --> 00:10:33,240
You saved my life.

150
00:10:33,600 --> 00:10:34,800
From now on,

151
00:10:34,960 --> 00:10:37,120
your business is my business.

152
00:10:37,480 --> 00:10:38,720
Just say the word.

153
00:10:38,800 --> 00:10:41,560
Whether it's going through fire or water,

154
00:10:41,560 --> 00:10:43,200
I'd be damned

155
00:10:43,440 --> 00:10:44,760
if I said no.

156
00:10:44,850 --> 00:10:45,690
Hui,

157
00:10:45,760 --> 00:10:47,000
you're being too serious.

158
00:10:47,000 --> 00:10:48,800
We are both from the Shisha Gang.

159
00:10:48,920 --> 00:10:50,320
It's the least I could do.

160
00:10:54,840 --> 00:10:56,280
Drink this bowl of wine,

161
00:10:56,480 --> 00:10:58,160
and we are like real brothers.

162
00:10:58,760 --> 00:10:59,400
Drink.

163
00:11:00,120 --> 00:11:00,880
Cheers.

164
00:11:05,870 --> 00:11:06,680
Good.

165
00:11:07,220 --> 00:11:08,090
Great.

166
00:11:08,880 --> 00:11:10,320
Seeing you like this,

167
00:11:10,400 --> 00:11:11,520
I am very pleased.

168
00:11:12,120 --> 00:11:12,900
Tianbai,

169
00:11:13,480 --> 00:11:14,840
after you've rested for a few days,

170
00:11:14,840 --> 00:11:15,840
how are you feeling?

171
00:11:15,840 --> 00:11:16,840
Thank you, Chief.

172
00:11:17,320 --> 00:11:18,380
I feel much better.

173
00:11:20,000 --> 00:11:22,280
It's good to be young.

174
00:11:22,280 --> 00:11:23,320
I should have

175
00:11:23,320 --> 00:11:25,400
let you rest for a few more days,

176
00:11:25,840 --> 00:11:27,960
but there is an urgent matter right now.

177
00:11:27,960 --> 00:11:29,160
Since Hui is injured,

178
00:11:29,460 --> 00:11:30,990
I can only leave this to you.

179
00:11:31,200 --> 00:11:32,000
Go ahead.

180
00:11:33,720 --> 00:11:34,720
Here's the thing.

181
00:11:36,120 --> 00:11:39,200
Mr. Smith, the boss
of Taigu Foreign Liquor Store,

182
00:11:39,600 --> 00:11:43,400
commissioned us to deliver a few boxes
of high-end foreign liquor to Jiangcheng,

183
00:11:43,400 --> 00:11:44,980
for Mr. William, the director

184
00:11:44,980 --> 00:11:46,840
of the Jiangcheng
Industrial and Commercial Bureau.

185
00:11:46,840 --> 00:11:48,960
I'm leaving this matter to you.

186
00:11:49,000 --> 00:11:50,000
Is that a problem?

187
00:11:50,920 --> 00:11:51,580
No problem.

188
00:11:52,200 --> 00:11:52,640
Good.

189
00:12:02,080 --> 00:12:02,680
Chief,

190
00:12:02,810 --> 00:12:04,070
I'll go prepare first.

191
00:12:13,350 --> 00:12:14,970
After someone is injected
with the wolf toxin,

192
00:12:14,970 --> 00:12:16,760
the closer it gets to the full moon,

193
00:12:16,760 --> 00:12:18,680
the sharper their 5 senses become.

194
00:12:18,680 --> 00:12:20,240
Wound healing accelerates,

195
00:12:20,240 --> 00:12:22,640
and they recover far better
than ordinary people.

196
00:12:22,640 --> 00:12:24,100
To alleviate the wolf toxin,

197
00:12:24,100 --> 00:12:27,200
a maintenance dose
must be injected every half month.

198
00:12:37,800 --> 00:12:38,880
No. 1.

199
00:12:40,840 --> 00:12:41,900
Strange.

200
00:12:42,160 --> 00:12:44,280
Why would the maintenance doses
be different?

201
00:12:44,280 --> 00:12:46,440
No. 2 is darker than No. 1.

202
00:12:51,160 --> 00:12:53,640
And that person clearly
took the maintenance dose.

203
00:12:53,640 --> 00:12:57,370
Why was he still tormented
by the wolf toxin to the point of suicide?

204
00:12:58,360 --> 00:12:59,680
Why did this happen?

205
00:13:10,560 --> 00:13:13,020
[Lu Mansion]

206
00:13:22,560 --> 00:13:24,160
Young Master, you're awake.

207
00:13:26,920 --> 00:13:27,730
Uncle Zhong.

208
00:13:27,920 --> 00:13:29,320
Help me contact someone.

209
00:13:31,080 --> 00:13:32,410
I need to give him a push.

210
00:13:43,840 --> 00:13:44,640
Chief!

211
00:13:45,640 --> 00:13:46,440
Chief!

212
00:13:47,240 --> 00:13:50,240
I don't know what tricks
that brat Lu Ye used

213
00:13:50,280 --> 00:13:53,560
to convince Smith
to let him go on the escort mission.

214
00:13:53,860 --> 00:13:55,030
Damn it!

215
00:13:55,040 --> 00:13:56,920
This is our business!

216
00:13:56,920 --> 00:13:58,450
What are you panicking for?

217
00:13:58,760 --> 00:13:59,680
Why?

218
00:13:59,920 --> 00:14:00,680
Are you afraid of him?

219
00:14:00,680 --> 00:14:01,280
Me?

220
00:14:01,280 --> 00:14:02,320
Afraid of him?

221
00:14:03,880 --> 00:14:05,760
Since he wants to go,

222
00:14:06,200 --> 00:14:08,920
let's make sure he never returns.

223
00:14:11,720 --> 00:14:12,680
Lu Wenbiao,

224
00:14:13,760 --> 00:14:16,240
your son brought this upon himself.

225
00:14:20,260 --> 00:14:21,730
-Extra! Extra!
-Boss.

226
00:14:22,610 --> 00:14:24,620
-This is the news we found.
-All the latest news

227
00:14:24,620 --> 00:14:25,980
out of Ningcheng!

228
00:14:26,000 --> 00:14:27,430
Come and take a look!

229
00:14:28,200 --> 00:14:30,200
Extra! Extra!

230
00:14:30,720 --> 00:14:33,880
All the latest news out of Ningcheng!

231
00:14:35,440 --> 00:14:36,770
What are you looking at?

232
00:14:38,200 --> 00:14:39,200
What are you doing here?
